{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/029.png?t=1747566093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve just been hired as the new night security guard at this massive mart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task is simple, walk the halls, check the offices, the store floor, and the warehouse, and activate all patrol panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever else happens during your shift\u2026 is not the company\u2019s concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/Activated01_-_Clipchamp.gif?t=1747566093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must patrol the mart as instructed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patrol panels are located in the office, the store area, and the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate all of these panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once every panel is activated, your daily duty is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/extras/KakaoTalk_20250516_130248863_01.jpg?t=1747566093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the pentagram panels in the abandoned mart in the normal, inverted, or random order to experience multiple endings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722070?t=1747566093","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/778d1d67c773449038c5988bf9ad2584cf336b44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747566093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/4d3aca0cca422342556f4f81e2cfc837cc151591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747566093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722070/4d3aca0cca422342556f4f81e2cfc837cc151591/ca